{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23391","headline":"和微之诗二十三首 和自劝二首 二 · 白居易","name":"和微之诗二十三首 和自劝二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"急景凋年急於水，念此揽衣中夜起。\n门无宿客共谁言，暖酒挑灯对妻子。\n身饮数杯妻一醆，余酌分张与儿女。\n微酣静坐未能眠，风霰萧萧打窗纸。\n自问有何才与术，入爲丞郎出刺史。\n争知寿命短复长，岂得营营心不止。\n请看韦孔与钱崔，半月之间四人死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}